  "instance_name": "audience_id",
  "label": "audience description",
  "description": "The target audience is individuals who hold or are susceptible to Islamophobic and misogynistic beliefs, particularly those who may identify with or support a nationalist or patriotic worldview that frames law enforcement as a tool for responding to perceived threats. The meme is designed to resonate with people who believe in the stereotypes it promotes — that Muslims hold a false belief about women being inherently dangerous, and that women are a threat requiring violent retaliation — and who may interpret the image of the female police officer as a symbol of American patriotism or authority acting against this perceived threat. The use of the American flag and the police officer as an authority figure serves to legitimize the hateful message for an audience that associates national identity with law and order, and who may be receptive to narratives that justify violence against Muslims and women.",
